---
import { TechCollage } from '@/components/home/TechCollage';
import './TechStack.scss';
---

<section class="tech-stack-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-eyebrow">
      <i class="pi pi-code"></i>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Tech Stack</h2>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="tech-grid">
    <div class="col-collage">
      <TechCollage client:load />
    </div>
    <div class="col-info">
      <p class="section-desc">
        Trabajo con un stack completo que abarca desde interfaces modernas hasta arquitecturas de
        backend robustas. Me especializo en
        <span class="highlight"> React</span>, <span class="highlight">Angular</span> y
        <span class="highlight">TypeScript</span> en el frontend, con experiencia sólida en APIs
        REST y GraphQL con <span class="highlight"> Node.js</span>, <span class="highlight">Java</span>
        y <span class="highlight">Spring Boot</span>.
      </p>
      <p class="section-desc">
        En base de datos manejo tanto relacionales como no relacionales —
        <span class="highlight">MySQL</span> y <span class="highlight"> MongoDB</span>. El diseño UI/UX con
        <span class="highlight"> Figma</span> y el control de versiones con
        <span class="highlight"> GitHub</span> son parte de mi flujo diario. También aplico
        <span class="highlight"> SEO técnico</span>, rendimiento web y accesibilidad.
      </p>
      <div class="categories">
        <div class="category">
          <span class="cat-dot frontend"></span>
          <span class="cat-label">Frontend</span>
          <div class="cat-tags">
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-react-original colored"></i>React</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-angular-plain colored"></i>Angular</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-typescript-plain colored"></i>TypeScript</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-sass-original colored"></i>SCSS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="category">
          <span class="cat-dot backend"></span>
          <span class="cat-label">Backend</span>
          <div class="cat-tags">
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-nodejs-plain colored"></i>Node.js</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-java-plain colored"></i>Java</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-spring-plain colored"></i>Spring Boot</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="category">
          <span class="cat-dot database"></span>
          <span class="cat-label">Database</span>
          <div class="cat-tags">
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-mysql-plain colored"></i>MySQL</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-mongodb-plain colored"></i>MongoDB</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="category">
          <span class="cat-dot tools"></span>
          <span class="cat-label">Tools</span>
          <div class="cat-tags">
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-figma-plain colored"></i>Figma</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-github-original"></i>GitHub</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="devicon-arduino-plain colored"></i>Arduino</span>
            <span class="cat-tag"><i class="pi pi-search"></i>SEO</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
